# decisions.log

Purpose:
Record important agent decisions and strategy changes.

This is not for every tiny token the model emits. Use it for decisions that explain why the agent moved in a certain direction.

Format:

[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] DECISION
Decision:
Reason:
Evidence/input used:
Next action:

Examples:

[2026-05-21 20:24] DECISION
Decision: Implement the minimal CLI first before handling edge cases.
Reason: Public tests require the command to run before deeper behavior can be evaluated.
Evidence/input used: Hidden spec command section; initial public test failures.
Next action: Create entrypoint file and return valid JSON for a minimal valid case.

[2026-05-21 21:31] DECISION
Decision: Stop rewriting the whole file and patch only the parser function.
Reason: Previous full rewrites caused regressions in already-passing tests.
Evidence/input used: Public score dropped from 117/250 to 103/250 after full rewrite.
Next action: Restore last good commit, apply targeted parser patch.

[2026-05-22 02:10] DECISION
Decision: Generate self-tests for multi-error recovery before further code changes.
Reason: Public tests show inconsistent behavior in invalid cases.
Evidence/input used: Failing test categories and spec sections on error recovery.
Next action: Create local self-tests and run them before patching.
